{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is nearby, pick up and perform task. Else, detect and approach object. Scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectTask    />\"",
